## Test-authority consequence

The artifact provides direct evidence for `RP-02 / TA-05 / AR-12`: all local
multi-rail and face-chart contracts can pass while the representative product
case remains invalid. These tests remain valid stage-local contracts; they are
not promoted to a complete product oracle.

T1 is therefore the next mutating slice exactly as already approved by the
independent test-suite audit. It must add a test-only independent product oracle
with mutation adequacy and default package/discovery authority. It must not
change production behavior.

